# Local-only snapshots of the remote Supabase project (schema dump, auth
# config, storage buckets, secret name/hash manifest, edge function source
# as actually deployed). Kept on disk for reference, never pushed - this repo
# is public, and even the redacted versions of these files reveal more about
# prod infra than should be public. Regenerate with the same commands
# whenever you want a fresh snapshot; delete old dated folders as you like.
supabase/backups/
